abstract = {Performance changes of software systems, and especially performance regressions, have a tremendous impact on users of that system. Historical data can help developers to reason about how performance has changed over the course of a software's lifetime. In this demo paper we present two tools: hopper to mine historical performance metrics based on benchmarks and unit tests, and gopper to analyse the data with respect to performance changes.},
