	author = {Agosta, Giovanni and Aldinucci, Marco and Alvarez, Carlos and Ammendola, Roberto and Arfat, Yasir and Beaumont, Olivier and Bernaschi, Massimo and Biagioni, Andrea and Boccali, Tommaso and Bramas, Berenger and Brandolese, Carlo and Cantalupo, Barbara and Carrozzo, Mauro and Cattaneo, Daniele and Celestini, Alessandro and Celino, Massimo and Colonnelli, Iacopo and Cretaro, Paolo and D’Ambra, Pasqua and Danelutto, Marco and Esposito, Roberto and Eyraud-Dubois, Lionel and Filgueras, Antonio and Fornaciari, William and Frezza, Ottorino and Galimberti, Andrea and Giacomini, Francesco and Goglin, Brice and Gregori, Daniele and Guermouche, Abdou and Iannone, Francesco and Kulczewski, Michal and Cicero, Francesca Lo and Lonardo, Alessandro and Martinelli, Alberto R. and Martinelli, Michele and Martorell, Xavier and Massari, Giuseppe and Montangero, Simone and Mittone, Gianluca and Namyst, Raymond and Oleksiak, Ariel and Palazzari, Paolo and Paolucci, Pier Stanislao and Reghenzani, Federico and Rossi, Cristian and Saponara, Sergio and Simula, Francesco and Terraneo, Federico and Thibault, Samuel and Torquati, Massimo and Turisini, Matteo and Vicini, Piero and Vidal, Miquel and Zoni, Davide and Zummo, Giuseppe},
