	doi = {https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-44-327726-9.00026-5},
	abstract = {Integrating real-time financial and production auditing, blockchain, and AI in economic management can lead to meaningful shifts in resource allocation and social welfare. Real-time auditing confirms vendor and tax compliance, adjusts salaries according to spending patterns, and provides a holistic view of individual and shared spending behavior. The real-time ranking and performance-based credit system empowers citizens by supporting essential expenses such as health and judicial services. Blockchain technology ensures the security and integrity of data, while AI enhances forecasting accuracy and decision-making in overseeing resources and citizen welfare. This framework promotes efficient resource flow across various sectors, ensuring transparency and favorable financial assistance. The holistic integration of these technologies improves financial operations, strengthens citizen welfare, and ensures stable and sustainable economic practices through real-time decision-making and resource distribution. In addition, sentiment analysis and social media trend analysis are conducted to examine the public's perception regarding real-time auditing and taxation, which shows promising results.},
