	abstract = {Concerning the establishment of Conformance Test Services in Europe the result of an invitation for tenders by the CEC in 1985 was that seven companies of six European countries concluded four contracts with the CEC in different technical areas. This means that these seven contractors are going to set up European Test Laboratories in the following areas: Teletex, Message Handling Systems, File Transfer Access and Management, and OSI 1-4. The aim of this project for the areas mentioned above is to certify for potential clients the conformity of their implementations to European Standards.},
